//! Match plan: what the draft works out once (whole map in view, 1M fuel) and writes into the
//! free bytes of draft memory, so champions (100k fuel per turn) don't have to.
//! Layout: docs/memory-layout.md ("Draft memory v3"). Read with knob2 DRAFT_PLAN bits.
//!
//! The plan is one logical buffer of [`PLAN_LEN`] bytes scattered over the draft-memory regions
//! the champions never read in play ([`SEGMENTS`]: the old FiLM, champion-vector and map-cache
//! blocks, and the tail). All-zero = no plan (version byte 0).

